From: Alexander Zaguzin <st7105@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 18:39:01 +0300
Subject: rtl8812au-ct: fix undeclared ndev in get_key callback

The cfg80211 7.2 API conversion changed cfg80211_rtw_get_key() to take
a wireless_dev instead of a net_device, but its DBG_871X() statement
still uses ndev. This breaks compilation with an undeclared identifier:

  ioctl_cfg80211.c: error: 'ndev' undeclared (first use in this function)

Derive ndev from wdev before the disabled code block, matching the other
converted callbacks. Bump PKG_RELEASE to rebuild the module.

Fixes: 3c1066f412f6 ("rtl8812au-ct: fix build with mac80211 7.2")
Link: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/25221
Signed-off-by: Alexander Zaguzin <st7105@gmail.com>

diff --git a/package/kernel/rtl8812au-ct/Makefile b/package/kernel/rtl8812au-ct/Makefile
index 95e0871dbc72aabce1f4b2831415f5a6dd594ba9..46218b449860aaf24be6b59d96319b58941982f8 100644
--- a/package/kernel/rtl8812au-ct/Makefile
+++ b/package/kernel/rtl8812au-ct/Makefile
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk
 
 PKG_NAME:=rtl8812au-ct
-PKG_RELEASE:=3
+PKG_RELEASE:=4
 
 PKG_LICENSE:=GPLv2
 PKG_LICENSE_FILES:=
diff --git a/package/kernel/rtl8812au-ct/patches/130-fix-get-key-netdev.patch b/package/kernel/rtl8812au-ct/patches/130-fix-get-key-netdev.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..dc7b9063baa296475f458e2a63c4364cbb58c4cf
--- /dev/null
+++ b/package/kernel/rtl8812au-ct/patches/130-fix-get-key-netdev.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Alexander Zaguzin <st7105@gmail.com>
+Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 18:39:01 +0300
+Subject: [PATCH] fix net_device reference in get_key callback
+
+The cfg80211 7.2 conversion changed the get_key callback argument to
+wireless_dev, but left its debug statement referring to ndev. Obtain the
+net_device from wdev, as the other converted callbacks already do.
+
+Signed-off-by: Alexander Zaguzin <st7105@gmail.com>
+---
+--- a/os_dep/linux/ioctl_cfg80211.c
++++ b/os_dep/linux/ioctl_cfg80211.c
+@@ -1540,6 +1540,7 @@ static int cfg80211_rtw_get_key(struct w
+                                 void (*callback)(void *cookie,
+                                         struct key_params*))
+ {
++	struct net_device *ndev = wdev_to_ndev(wdev);
+ #if 0
+ 	struct iwm_priv *iwm = ndev_to_iwm(ndev);
+ 	struct iwm_key *key = &iwm->keys[key_index];
